                      "kind": "binding",
                      "statement": "After authorization, file_response chooses the effective file document from request_doc and root_doc; a version request_doc is selected directly when no version parameter is supplied, otherwise version resolution against the root selects the file document.",
                      "citations": [
                        {
                          "sourceId": "src-62f289a6149b051c",
